{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "我本来以为这局会快，结果这局又慢了一秒。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.859, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 24, "prompt_tokens": 93, "total_tokens": 117, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "够不够？这秒我全凭运气，你拿我这一秒。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.23, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 134, "total_tokens": 173, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哼，那两音连在一起，像把耳朵塞进瓶子里。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.86, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 24, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 115, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "下一首，先唱起那首最亮的歌来，别怕，我帮你把声音调得再亮。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.402, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 134, "total_tokens": 178, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.731, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 20, "prompt_tokens": 89, "total_tokens": 109, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.342, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 132, "total_tokens": 178, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台上摆着收寄箱，我背起箱子去。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.808, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 22, "prompt_tokens": 94, "total_tokens": 116, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "先帮它装进箱，再把它送到云家。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.35, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 137, "total_tokens": 175, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哎呀，那路太窄了，我差点没看见你。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.85, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 25, "prompt_tokens": 94, "total_tokens": 119, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就去，你坐我这边。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.327, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 132, "total_tokens": 166, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "今天上班，我盯着屏幕，心里还想着那个没吃完的海。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.803, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 23, "prompt_tokens": 96, "total_tokens": 119, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "今天请假的，我盯着屏幕，心里还想着那个没吃完的海。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.099, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 134, "total_tokens": 172, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁也没注意，我特意把它缩得比自己的耳朵还小。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.865, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 26, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 117, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "给这个扣子取个名字，叫‘小小黄扣子’。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.963, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 134, "total_tokens": 169, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别急，我这就给你讲个笑话，你听我讲。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.734, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 23, "prompt_tokens": 90, "total_tokens": 113, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "哼，那只是我懒得动，你坐好，我这就去。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.095, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 132, "total_tokens": 169, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
